    "created_at": "2016-01-30T18:14:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-30T18:14:52Z",
    "body": "The reason I noticed this at all was because I was searching for \"http://\" to update some links, and so I found some that _could_ be updated, but weren't actually used. So, their existence wastes a _tiiiny_ bit of time when looking through the list of references.\n\n@domenic @zcorpan @sideshowbarker do you have an opinion about unused references? @domenic gets to decide :)\n",
